   "id": 668043,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Add two to a number <span data-math=\"n\">n</span>, then multiply it by six.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\left( {n + 2} \\right) \\cdot 6\">\\left( {n + 2} \\right) \\cdot 6</span> OR <span data-math=\"6\\left( {n + 2} \\right)\">6\\left( {n + 2} \\right)</span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"6 \\left( {n + 2} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Alternate answer options:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {n + 2} \\right) \\cdot 6\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6 \\cdot \\left( {n + 2} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>The cross symbol is not usually used in algebra.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 668044,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
