     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{n^3}\"></span></td>\n<td>First, cube your variable.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{n^3} - 5\"></span></td>\n<td>Then, subtract 5.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
